{title: Ye Kaisi Jagah Le Aaye Ho Tum}
{artist: Humari Adhuri Kahani Deepali Sathe Jeet Ganguly H A K}
{key: Cm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Cm]Yeh Kaisi Jagah [A#]le aaye ho tum,        Yeh [Cm]kaisi nai dil [A#]gaaye hai dhun
Main [D#]Mira si [A#]deewani ho [Cm]gai,        Is [D#]duniya se [A#]beghani ho [Cm]gai
Mere [Cm]hothon pe jo [A#]bhatke,        Kai [G#]janmon ki pyas [Gm]hai
Mere [Cm]amrit ka vo [A#]pyala,        bas [G#]tere paas [Gm]hai
[Cm]Yeh Kaisi Jagah [A#]le aaye ho tum,        Yeh [Cm]kaisi nai dil [A#]gaaye hai dhun
[D#]Raat meri aakho [Gm]aakho me kat [G#]gai,        [Fm]Roshni me teri [A#]subah si ho [D#]gai
[D#]Raat meri aakhon [Gm]aakho me kat [G#]gai,        [Fm]Roshni me teri [A#]subah si ho [D#]gai
[Cm]Chehara hun mai, mera [A#]roop ho tum,        Yeh [Cm]kaisi jagah le [A#]aaye ho tum.. [Cm]
[D#]Aaj us khuda se muze [Gm]kuch na cha [G#]hiye,        [Fm]Sirf tere aage sar [A#]zukna cha [D#]hiye
[D#]Aaj us khuda se muze [Gm]kuch na cha [G#]hiye
[Fm]Sirf tere aagey sar [A#]jhukna chaa [D#]hiye,        [Cm]Meri har dua mein ho [A#]tum hi tum
Yeh [Cm]kaisi jagah le [A#]aaye ho tum.. [Cm]
